    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Oldenborn (Sky-Threaded)</em> at level 11; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You don’t run. You re-route.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Jetstream Traverse (1/Long Rest).</strong> For 10 minutes, you gain a flying speed equal to your walking speed, but you must end your turn on solid ground (or fall normally). When this ends, you are not harmed by the fall from the last 10 feet.</p>",
